The Conjuring: The Devil Made Me Do It was released by Warner Bros.

23
01:31:10,714 --> 01:31:16,714
Pictures and New Line Cinema in the United States on June 4, 2021, and also had a
simultaneous month-long release on the HBO Max streaming service.

24
